# WARP-8: EDIT held, a knob of the picked drum's turns that knob on all eleven drums; HOME + REC takes it back.
# RANDOM SOUND in the drum's list: another of its type's sounds
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
tap EDIT
wait 40
expect page Engine
expect par1.d1.k2 42
expect par1.d2.k2 40
press EDIT
turn K2 5
release EDIT
wait 40
said ALL DRUMS
expect page Engine
expect par1.d1.k2 47
expect par1.d2.k2 45
# a knob alone: the picked drum's only
turn K2 1
wait 40
expect par1.d1.k2 48
expect par1.d2.k2 45
# the kit's own knobs (Character) are not the drums': EDIT held changes nothing else there
shot ctlall.png
# HOME + REC: the sound's turns taken back (those made in one moment are one undo)
press HOME
tap REC
release HOME
wait 40
expect par1.d1.k2 42
expect par1.d2.k2 40
# the drum's list: RANDOM SOUND puts one of its type's sounds on the drum (a Hortator model: 30 and up)
tap SEL
wait 40
row RANDOM SOUND
tap SEL
wait 40
said DRUM SOUND
expect par1.d1.model >29
